      "paragraphs": [
        "We drive life-saving medical breakthroughs, advocate for better health, and bring together the brightest minds to improve diagnosis, care and support. Our key priorities are:",
        "After using the Risk Screen tool, Sharon was surprised by some of her unique risks. Knowing them helped her take action.",
        "Dr. Michael Hill recounts the close calls and hard work behind a life-saving revolution.",
        "Dr. West’s bold idea rewrote the rules of heart transplants, saving babies’ lives.",
        "Celebrate your loved one’s memory and make a lasting impact.",
        "Help fund lifesaving breakthroughs while reducing capital gains tax.",
        "Join fundraisers coming together to beat heart disease and stroke.",
        "Jump-start the joy of movement at your school!",
        "Mindful drinking — or living your best sober life — is better for your heart and brain health. by Christine Sismondo, PhD",
        "Mindful drinking — or living your best sober life — is better for your heart and brain health.",
        "by Christine Sismondo, PhD",
        "Decrease screen time and feel better. by Sydney Loney",
        "Decrease screen time and feel better.",
        "by Sydney Loney",
        "Feeling overwhelmed? The answer might be right outside your door.",
        "Looking for a simple way to get moving and enjoy the outdoors? Walking is a great place to start — and Canada offers endless places to explore."
      ],
